      "text": "⚡️🇮🇷 There are few reasons why the US would engage in a small scale bombing campaign of Southern Iran. None of it is smart, but some are practically forced by the situational environment the Americans find themselves in.\n\n1) Assurances to the global market that the US *is* trying to police the Strait of Hormuz, even small gestures of bombing a few IRGC installations shows that the US did not abandon the war effort or the insurance markets to the wolves, but that they are still engaged.\n\n2) Political assurances to Israel that the US is still involved in the war and will get itself involved in a confrontation with Iran again if needed.\n\nThese are the only two that honestly make sense, they are not tactically sound and is, in fact, retarded, but governments sometimes do retarded things out of the conditions they find themselves in.\n\n@medmannews",
